msgid ""
"Add a new field to an existing IvyForms form. Supported types: text, "
"textarea, email, number, phone, website, name, radio, checkbox, select, "
"multi-select, address, date, time, rating, html. When IvyForms Pro is "
"active, password and signature are also supported. After adding a field, use "
"open-form-builder to let the user see and configure."
msgstr ""
"Aggiungi un nuovo campo a un modulo IvyForms esistente. Tipi supportati: "
"text, textarea, email, number, phone, website, name, radio, checkbox, "
"select, multi-select, address, date, time, rating, html. Quando IvyForms Pro "
"è abilitato, sono supportati anche password e signature. Dopo aver aggiunto "
"un campo, usa open-form-builder per consentire all’utente di visualizzarlo e "
"configurarlo."

